    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/50e47697d0baeac62d2f0658e294fc89.avif?t=1750757724\" width=647 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OCCT (OverClock Checking Tool) is the best software for testing system stability, diagnosing hardware issues, and monitoring performance. Whether you're an overclocking enthusiast, a technician, or just want to ensure your PC is running smoothly, OCCT provides a powerful suite of tools to push your hardware to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/39b7abced2eb188601d56694d01fda75.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/3ca311a6435efec68afd2b4c1dfd54f5.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=29 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Processor (CPU)</strong> \u2013 Evaluate your CPU\u2019s stability and performance with various test modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics Card (GPU)</strong> \u2013 Push your GPU to its limits with DirectX and CUDA-specific stress tests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory (RAM)</strong> \u2013 Detect potential errors by putting your RAM under heavy load.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Supply (PSU)</strong> \u2013 Simulate extreme power consumption to assess PSU reliability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/a8ea2bcd5ded190a6b6ba774484892ae.poster.avif?t=1750757724\" width=800 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/a8ea2bcd5ded190a6b6ba774484892ae.webm?t=1750757724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/a8ea2bcd5ded190a6b6ba774484892ae.mp4?t=1750757724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/39b7abced2eb188601d56694d01fda75.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/71b9aba0e79dc111993887352f4906c4.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With OCCT\u2019s <strong>Stability Certificates</strong>, you can <strong>validate your system\u2019s stability</strong> like never before. After passing a complete series of stress tests, receive a <strong>personalized, shareable certificate</strong> proving your hardware's robustness. Perfect for benchmarking, troubleshooting, or simply showcasing the performance of your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/47c27b36cc95b665d6849f9eafd07f0b.poster.avif?t=1750757724\" width=800 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/47c27b36cc95b665d6849f9eafd07f0b.webm?t=1750757724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/47c27b36cc95b665d6849f9eafd07f0b.mp4?t=1750757724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/cc119540ead62b1ff76767b35127ac5d.avif?t=1750757724\" data-has-big width=800 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/39b7abced2eb188601d56694d01fda75.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/f9244b2b7c77dc3bf723a6e35c80805b.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OCCT includes a powerful monitoring system that tracks: <br>\u2714 Temperatures (CPU, GPU, VRM\u2026) <br>\u2714 Clock speeds and voltages <br>\u2714 Resource usage <br>\u2714 Sensor data (fans, power consumption, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/a4f78c225cdaacfa1ac741ea7dbe51ee.poster.avif?t=1750757724\" width=800 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/a4f78c225cdaacfa1ac741ea7dbe51ee.webm?t=1750757724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/a4f78c225cdaacfa1ac741ea7dbe51ee.mp4?t=1750757724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/39b7abced2eb188601d56694d01fda75.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=2 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/011c9032b61db5fda3f07db6550afb83.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=29 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each test, OCCT generates in-depth reports to help you analyze performance and detect potential hardware issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/39b7abced2eb188601d56694d01fda75.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/ba8098f06f30edc7ee7376ef1deaa6c2.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a modern and easy-to-use design, OCCT is perfect for both beginners and advanced users.</p>",
